      "content": "The darkness won't judge you because it will finally take you with it.\nSurrender your remaining strength to the void; it is the only mercy left for a broken man.\nLet the cold embrace you now, and let that final silence be the only peace you will ever know.\nThere is no other way out for someone who has already lost everything.",
